    <string name="about_body">I-BenSuet Stay isiza abafundi beSewula Afrika bona bafumane indawo yokuhlala ephephileko neqinisekisiweko hlanu nekhampasi yabo, neenkhetho ze-NSFAS nezokuzibhadela endaweni yinye. Yakhiwe yi-Mansuet Dev.</string>
