    <string name="delete_account_confirm_title">Susa i-akhawunti yakho?</string>
    <string name="delete_account_confirm_body">Lokhu kususa unomphela iphrofayili yakho ye-BenSuet Stay nokungena kwakho. Lokhu angeze kwabuyiselwa emuva.</string>
    <string name="account_deleted">I-akhawunti yakho isusiwe.</string>
    <string name="privacy_policy_body">I-BenSuet Stay ibuthelela kwaphela lokho ekutlhogako bona ihlanganise abafundi neendawo zokuhlala.\n\nEsikubuthelelako: ibizo lakho, i-imeyili, ikheli lekhaya, isikhungo nohlobo lwesekelo. Nawenza isibawo sekamero sibulunga nenomboro yakho yomazisi ye-SA, inomboro yomfundi, ikhampasi, imininingwana yesihlobo esiseduze namabizo wamatlolo owakhethileko. Kubanikazi beendlu: ibizo, i-imeyili nenomboro yomtato.\n\nKubayini: ukutjengisa iindawo ezifaneleko, ukuvumela abanikazi beendlu bona baphathe ukuqala neembawo zakho, nokukuthumelela iimvuselelo ngazo.\n\nNgubani ongakubona: nguwe kwaphela, umnikazi wendlu wendawo othintana nayo, nabaphathi be-BenSuet Stay. Imithetho yokuphepha yesibulungelo sethu sedatha iqinisekisa lokhu.\n\nLapho kubulungwa khona: Google Firebase (Cloud Firestore, isifunda seGoli). Amaphasiwedi aphathwa yi-Firebase Authentication begodu akabulungwa yi-app.\n\nAmalungelo wakho ngaphasi kwe-POPIA: ungaqala begodu uvuselele imininingwana yakho ku-Iinlungiselelo, begodu ususe i-akhawunti yakho nanini ku-Iinlungiselelo → Ifihlo → Susa i-akhawunti yami. Kokhunye, sebenzisa Iinlungiselelo → Isizo → Thintana nesizo.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q1">Ngibhuka njani ukuqala indawo?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a1">Vula isikhangiso bese uthepha u-Bhukela ukuqala, bese ukhetha ilanga nesikhathi. Umnikazi wendlu uyakuqinisekisa namkha akwale, begodu ufumana isaziso kinanyana kunjani.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q2">Ngenza njani isibawo sekamero?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a2">Vula isikhangiso, khetha uhlobo lwekamero bese uthepha u-Khetha ikamero. Abafundi be-NSFAS baqinisekisa imininingwana yabo ye-NSFAS; abazibhadelako bengeza imininingwana yesihlobo esiseduze namatlolo wabo. Kulandelele ku-Iinlungiselelo → Iimbawo zami.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q3">Ngingayisebenzisa i-app ngaphandle kwe-inthanethi?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a3">Iye. Iinkhangiso osele uzivulile zihlala zibonakala, begodu iimbawo zokuqala namkha iimbawo ozenze ungekho ku-inthanethi zibulungwa emtatweni wakho bese zithunyelwa ngokuzenzakalelako nawuphinda uthintane.</string>
    <string name="faq_s_q4">Kubayini ngingaboni zoke iindawo zokuhlala?</string>
    <string name="faq_s_a4">Ikhasi lekhaya lithoma ngohlobo lwakho lwesekelo begodu u-Hlanu nekhampasi yami kuvuliwe. Thepha u-Koke namkha u-Hlanu nekhampasi yami bona wandise ukufuna, namkha utjhugulule lokhu ku-Iinlungiselelo → Isikrini sekhaya.</string>
    <string name="faq_l_q1">Ngubani owakha begodu alungise iinkhangiso zami?</string>
    <string name="faq_l_a1">Isihlopha sabaphathi be-BenSuet Stay sakha iinkhangiso bese sikunikela zona. Bona utjhugulule isikhangiso namkha imininingwana yakho, sebenzisa u-Thintana nesizo, namkha u-Bawa itjhuguluko ngaphasi kwe-Imininingwana yakho.</string>
    <string name="faq_l_q2">Ngiziphatha njani iimbawo zokuqala?</string>
    <string name="faq_l_a2">Vula u-Ukubhuka bese uqinisekisa namkha wale isibawo ngasinye. Nawala, nikela isizathu bese uphakamisa esinye isikhathi. Umfundi wazisiwa msinyana.</string>
    <string name="faq_l_q3">Kwenzekani nangivumela isibawo?</string>
    <string name="faq_l_a3">Isikhala sinye sisuswa kilolo hlobo lwekamero ngokuzenzakalelako, begodu umfundi ubona itlolwana lakho ku-Iimbawo zami.</string>
</resources>
